[I] Fully-featured audio plugin host

[T] Carla is a fully-featured audio plugin host supporting LADSPA, DSSI,
[T] LV2, VST2, VST3 and AU plugins as well as SF2/3 and SFZ sound banks. It
[T] offers rack and patchbay processing modes, an internal audio and MIDI
[T] file player, MIDI CC automation, OSC remote control, and works with JACK
[T] and native audio drivers.

[U] https://github.com/falkTX/Carla

[A] Carla Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

